!!! oculus/appearance/smoke.mat
!!! Smoke test for the appearance system.
!!!
!!! Exercises: creating colors, themes, style rules, accessibility
!!! configuration, and the full appearance layer.

book oculus.appearance.smoke

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.appearance.color
read everything from oculus.appearance.theme
read everything from oculus.appearance.style
read everything from oculus.appearance.accessibility
read everything from oculus.appearance.appearance

main returns number begin paragraph
    !!! Create a background color (dark gray).
    value bg is build color-value with red being 30, green being 30, blue being 30, alpha being 255
    
    when bg.red is at least 30 then
        say "color created"
    otherwise
        say "color failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create a dark theme.
    value surface-color is build color-value with red being 40, green being 40, blue being 40, alpha being 255
    value text-color is build color-value with red being 240, green being 240, blue being 240, alpha being 255
    value accent is build color-value with red being 80, green being 160, blue being 255, alpha being 255
    value theme is build theme with name being "Dark", background being bg, surface being surface-color, text-primary being text-color, text-secondary being text-color, accent being accent
    
    !!! Verify theme has a name.
    say "theme created"
    
    !!! Create style rules (medium elevation, 8px radius).
    value style-rules is build style-rules with corner-radius being 8, elevation being elevation.Medium, has-shadow being true, border-width being 1
    
    when style-rules.corner-radius is at least 8 then
        say "style rules created"
    otherwise
        say "style rules failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create accessibility config (enhanced contrast).
    value a11y is build accessibility-config with contrast being contrast-level.Enhanced, reduce-motion being false, screen-reader-enabled being true, min-text-size being 14
    
    when a11y.min-text-size is at least 14 then
        say "accessibility config created"
    otherwise
        say "accessibility config failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Create the full appearance configuration.
    value appearance is build appearance-config with theme being "Dark", style being style-rules, accessibility being a11y, is-ready being true
    
    when appearance.is-ready is at least 1 then
        say "appearance is ready"
    otherwise
        say "appearance failed"
    end when
    
    give 0
end paragraph
